uplink-tactical-deniability-implanter-name = Tactical Deniability Implanter
uplink-tactical-deniability-implanter-desc = Keeps the user out of critical condition but arms a delayed explosion when they would enter it. Absorbs other explosive implants. Can also be triggered manually.
uplink-autosurgeon-arm-electrification-name = Right Arm Electrification Autosurgeon
uplink-autosurgeon-arm-electrification-desc = Installs a retractable contact electrode in the right arm.
uplink-autosurgeon-left-laser-arm-name = Left Laser Arm Autosurgeon
uplink-autosurgeon-right-laser-arm-name = Right Laser Arm Autosurgeon
uplink-autosurgeon-laser-arm-desc = Installs a retractable, self-recharging laser in the selected arm. Vulnerable to EMPs.
